{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q2075342","formula":"(SrNa)Ti₂Na₃Ti(Si₂O₇)₂O₂(OH)₂","hill":"H2Na4O18Si4SrTi3","elements":["H","O","Na","Si","Ti","Sr"],"composition":{"H":2.0,"O":18.0,"Na":4.0,"Si":4.0,"Sr":1.0,"Ti":3.0},"names":{"en":"Lamprophyllite","ru":"Лампрофиллит","uk":"Лампрофіліт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Lamprophyllite (named for its lustrous cleavage) is a rare, but widespread mineral Ti-silicate mineral usually found in intrusive agpaitic igneous rocks. Yellow, reddish brown, Vitreous, Pearly. Lamprophyllite formula is (Sr,Ba,K,Na)2Na(Na,Fe,Mn)2Ti[Ti2O2(Si2O7)2[(O, OH,F)2 .","ru":"Лампрофиллит — минерал, островной диортосиликат натрия, циркония и титана, с добавочными анионами (OH)-, O2-, F-. Название в переводе с греческого означает «филлитес» — листоватый, «лямпрос» — блестящий, за пластинчатые формы кристаллов с сильным блеском на плоскостях спайности. Минерал был открыт в 1894 году.","uk":"Лампрофіліт (рос. лампрофиллит; англ. lamprophylite; нім."},"fame":13,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2075342","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lamprophyllite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9B%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%84%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9B%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%84%D1%96%D0%BB%D1%96%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lamprophyllite-294801.jpg","license":"CC BY 3.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q69567